<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST7148"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Fsu44<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Fsu44<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->1-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Saturday, February 12, 2005 - 11:27 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->truant officer maybe...they have been long gone!<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 7148-->
<!--Post: 7150--><!--Time: 1108237610-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST7150"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Cougar<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Cougar<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->10-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Saturday, February 12, 2005 - 11:46 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Fsu44 - wasn&#39;t it you who said that BTK made an error with his last drop and that you knew his ID because of this? If not, please accept my sincere apologies. If so this has me wondering if this poster &#40; Preacher3 - exhortist &#41; is you. <!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 7150-->
<!--Post: 7161--><!--Time: 1108245045-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST7161"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Fsu44<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Fsu44<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->1-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Saturday, February 12, 2005 - 1:50 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->I did say he made a major mistake with the last drop. I wish I could say I know his ID, he would be in the hands of LE. <!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 7161-->
<!--Post: 7166--><!--Time: 1108247891-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST7166"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><a href="mailto:vscantu1@msn.com" target="_blank"><!--/email--><!--name-->Vscantu<!--/name--></b></a>
</a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Vscantu<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Saturday, February 12, 2005 - 2:38 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->MCATTITUDE: Very interesting post at the top here. But for the life of me I don&#39;t see anywhere in that guys&#39; tale where it shows he was in fact BTK. No mention of murders, bondage or letter-writing at all! <BR> <BR>I agree with FSU44: It sounds like a fascinating &#34;true-detective&#34; tale. Only it has no evidence that this wannabe cop is BTK whatsoever!<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 7166-->
<!--Post: 7172--><!--Time: 1108255820-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST7172"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Fsu44<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Fsu44<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->1-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Saturday, February 12, 2005 - 4:50 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Cougar: I am not Preacher3-exhortist, I&#39;m a homicide investigator from Florida. FSU is my almamater and I am 44 years old. Now that was easy, only if BTK was that easy..LOL! <!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 7172-->
<!--Post: 7179--><!--Time: 1108262138-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST7179"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Mel1pred<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Mel1pred<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Saturday, February 12, 2005 - 6:35 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->They had truant officers at all the high schools in Wichita in the early 70&#39;s still.  <!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 7179-->
<!--Post: 7188--><!--Time: 1108267636-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST7188"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Iceteajan<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Iceteajan<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Saturday, February 12, 2005 - 8:07 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->The poster claims:   <BR> <BR>“I never was unduly afraid of this guy and just had forgotten about that incident until my memory was jogged by that story.” <BR> <BR>Well, by gosh, don’t you think you ought to be afraid of a dude that pulls a sharp knife to your throat?  GEESH!!!! <BR> <BR>Okay, assuming this is authentic, the poster also states “. . . .lifted that badge from the truant officer. . .”   <BR> <BR>Well, was BTK an accomplished pickpocket?  Is that how he got his fake IDs?  Was the truant officer really the railroad detective that BTK supposedly knew in his childhood? <BR> <BR>A Walther P-38?  A gun was used in one the attacks on the victim’s brother – what type was it? <BR> <BR>My advice:  Stop wasting time posting in the forum; simply report the suspect to the authorities.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 7188-->
<!--Post: 7217--><!--Time: 1108287759-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST7217"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Bluepup<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Bluepup<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Sunday, February 13, 2005 - 1:42 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Hmmm  - That exact same message is posted on the Kansas.com board by Preacher3. And if you read back thru his posts it wasn&#39;t his first message about knowing BTK. And he also states he did tell LE.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 7217-->
<!--Post: 7240--><!--Time: 1108318730-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST7240"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Cougar<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Cougar<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->10-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Sunday, February 13, 2005 - 10:18 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Thanks, Fsu. I just HAD to ask, lol.  <BR> <BR>So is anyone actually taking this P3-Exhortist person seriously? <!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 7240-->
<!--Post: 7244--><!--Time: 1108320597-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST7244"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Iceteajan<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Iceteajan<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Sunday, February 13, 2005 - 10:49 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Cougar, <BR> <BR>Well, I even wonder if this particular post is actually responsible for the Yahoo lockdown? <BR> <BR>I don&#39;t know if anybody is taking this seriously, but in fairness, everybody should at least give the story some consideration. <BR> <BR>The poster speaks of the &#34;small surrounding area town like Anthony&#34; -- that appears to be the discerning information &#40;at least for the poster&#41; that prompted his/her thoughts.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
